TRAFFIC ADVISORY

In view of the ‘Grand Bathukamma Celebrations’ at #Saroornagar_Indoor_Stadium on 29th Sept. 2025 (Monday)
➔Traffic restrictions will be in place from 1500 hrs to 2100 hrs today.
➔Citizens are requested to AVOID the stretch from #LBNagar to #Kothapet via Saroornagar Indoor Stadium during this period.
➔Please opt for alternate routes to ensure your convenience and public safety.

Plan your journeys accordingly and cooperate with #RachakondaTrafficPolice for the smooth and peaceful conduct of this grand cultural event.

#TrafficAdvisory #Bathukamma #RachakondaPolice

